{'symbol': 'JNPR', 'date': '2022-09-07 17:12:00', 'title': 'GREAT PLACE TO WORK® AND FORTUNE NAME JUNIPER NETWORKS ONE OF THE 2022 BEST WORKPLACES IN TECHNOLOGY™', 'text': 'SUNNYVALE, CALIF.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--JUNIPER NETWORKS (NYSE:JNPR), A LEADER IN SECURE, AI-DRIVEN NETWORKS, HAS BEEN HONORED BY GREAT PLACE TO WORK® AS ONE OF THE 2022 BEST WORKPLACES IN TECHNOLOGY™. EARNING A SPOT ON THIS PRESTIGIOUS LIST MEANS THAT JUNIPER IS ONE OF THE BEST COMPANIES TO WORK FOR IN THE COUNTRY. THE BEST WORKPLACES IN TECHNOLOGY AWARD IS BASED ON ANALYSIS OF SURVEY RESPONSES FROM OVER 151,000 CURRENT EMPLOYEES FROM GREAT PLACE TO WORK-CERTIFIED™ COMPANIES IN THE TECH INDUSTRY.'}